dizi changes to drivers/ShengUfs (UniXNU/ShengUfs 2f6c7b0). Apply in drivers/ShengUfs with: git apply ../../patches/drivers/ShengUfs-dizi.patch
Boot-args: native-ufs-stream=0x20 (dizi SMMU stream), native-ufs-smmu-reuse=1 (keep the hypervisor's mapping), native-ufs-zero-copy=0,
native-ufs-allow-unverified=1 (publish the root without the owner bundle). Also: the probe 8 survey reports the stream's bank, and
the timing helpers are outside NATIVE_VERIFIED_BLOCK and read the virtual counter.

